From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Opz Browser <opz@localhost>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 17:44:53 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] URL bar: a long idle address is cut off at 440px

The idle address grew with its text up to the width cap of the bar
(100vw - 640px), so a long address stretched across the toolbar. Its
text box now stops at 440px and the rest fades out as usual.
---
 browser/themes/shared/urlbar.css | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/browser/themes/shared/urlbar.css b/browser/themes/shared/urlbar.css
index 3fe20da557..261ca5d732 100644
--- a/browser/themes/shared/urlbar.css
+++ b/browser/themes/shared/urlbar.css
@@ -1684,6 +1684,12 @@ toolbar[inactive="true"] .urlbar,
   > .urlbar-input-container > .urlbar-input-box > #urlbar-input {
     field-sizing: content;
   }
+
+  /* A long address is cut off (with the usual fade) rather than stretching
+     the bar across the toolbar. */
+  > .urlbar-input-container > .urlbar-input-box {
+    max-width: 440px;
+  }
 }
 
 /* Opz: the address bar's container spans the toolbar, but while idle the bar
